<title>EGYPT: SOCCER-EGYPT SLAMS LIBERIA IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EGYPT SLAMS LIBERIA IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt beat Liberia 5-0 (halftime 2-0) in their World Cup soccer African zone group two qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: </p>
<p>Egypt - Hadi Khashaba (penalty), Hisham Hanafi, Abdel-Sattar Sabri, Sami Kammouna, Hazem Imam.</p>
